{"id":"ff895a99ef2c37b3","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-omega-range.md","title":"二随机实数落在某个 Omega 算子的值域","display":"thm-2random-omega-range — 二随机实数落在某个 Omega 算子的值域","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-omega-range","aliases":["43-thm-2random-omega-range"],"display":"thm-2random-omega-range — 二随机实数落在某个 Omega 算子的值域","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-df-omega-operator]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 18.4.1 combined with Corollary 18.3.4","source_printed_pages":"558","source_pdf_pages":"578","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-omega-range"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-omega-range</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-omega-range — 二随机实数落在某个 Omega 算子的值域"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 18.4.1 combined with Corollary 18.3.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"558"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"578"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\">\\(x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Random}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Random}_2\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a> 中的二随机谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A\">\\(\\Omega_U^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Random}_2(X)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Random}_2(X)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>U 可以依赖于 X；定理没有声称每个二随机实数都在同一个预先固定算子的值域中。原书先令 A=(1−x+Ω)/2，得到相对左 c.e. 性与相对随机性，再使用上一节的表示结论。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 18.4.1 combined with Corollary 18.3.4，印刷页 558，PDF 页 578。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}$。$\\operatorname{Random}_2$ 采用 [[43-df-2random]] 中的二随机谓词；$\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$、$\\Omega_U^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}$。$\\operatorname{Random}_2$ 采用 [[43-df-2random]] 中的二随机谓词；$\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$、$\\Omega_U^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Random}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Random}_2(X)\\Longrightarrow\\exists A\\in2^\\omega\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\land\\Omega_U^A=x\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-2random-omega-range]] — 二随机实数落在某个 Omega 算子的值域"}],"outgoing":["c6460737e81fabbf","06809317851331